We now provide a randomized algorithm that computes, 
for each cluster $S_i\in \sset$ an internal $S_i$-router $\qset(S_i)$.  Additionally, we compute a partition $(\sset^{\bad},\sset^{\light})$ of the clusters in $\sset$. Initially, we set $\sset^{\bad}=\sset^{\light}=\emptyset$.

