\begin{observation}
\label{obs: congestion square of internal routers}
For every cluster  $S_i\in \sset^{\light}$, for every edge $e\in E(S_i)$:
$\expect{\left (\cong_{G}(\qset(S_i),e)\right )^2}\le \hat \eta$.
