Once every edge of $\delta_G(U_i)$ is processed, we set  $\qset(U_i)=\set{Q(e)\mid e\in \delta(U_i)}$ and  $\qset'(U_i)=\set{Q'(e)\mid e\in \delta(U_i)}$. It is immediate to verify that $\qset(U_i)$ is an internal $U_i$-router, while $\qset'(U_i)$ is an external $U_i$-router.

